# Adapted from Aurum's chapter aurum-druid/excavation-site (Aurums Night Elf Druid Guide 0.4.37,
# GPL-3.0). Changes: for every class, Sarltooth and the book pickups left to Polestar's own
# guides, shorter tips, group notes. Ids cross-checked against Polestar 0.3.2's reference data
# and Dungeons codex, and the MittenQuest and Lodestar Forever packs (Wetlands).
# 0.4.0 (BurN-30): moved after Thousand Needles (its quests are level 31 on Wowhead Forever, its
# last boss 31: Wowhead's dungeon guide of 2026-11-05 advises 26 to 32, not 24); optional (asked
# once, `when group 95647`, then `when done xs-start`), the dungeon step by step, the Songblade
# quests for whoever took Dorin's in Lakeshire (08b-prison), facts and tips from Wowhead Forever
# (pages and comments read on 2026-11-08), rewritten.
guide groupe-alliance/10-site-de-fouilles
title Group 10 · Excavation Site: Wetlands (dungeon 28-32)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 29-32
zone Wetlands
next groupe-alliance/12-dalaran

step Back to Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  when !zone "Wetlands"
  tip From Thousand Needles: use your hearthstone, bound in Menethil's Deepwater Tavern.
  goto 10.7,61.0 "Deepwater Tavern"

step Menethil Harbor: dungeon quests
  label xs-start
  when group 95647
  tip Excavation Site: a 5-player Forever dungeon up the hill in the middle of the Wetlands, best at 28 to 31, with 5 players (4 with a real tank or healer). Everything inside is elite and the last boss is 31: about 39,000 XP of quests and blue rewards. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to Dalaran.
  note Keep 6 free quest log slots. Caitlin Grassman is in her house, James Halloran by the north gate. Seeking Caitlin, from Llana in Astranaar, can no longer be taken once you hold Caitlin's quest.
  level 28
  turnin 95737 optional                       -- Caitlin Grassman: Seeking Caitlin, if you took it in Astranaar
  accept 95647
  accept 98815                                -- Needs Young Crocolisk Skins done

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  when done xs-start
  tip On the Green Belt, east of the road. He gives it once his three earlier quests are done (The Greenwarden, Tramping Paws, Fire Taboo, then Blisters on the Land).
  accept 95646 optional

step Excavation Site entrance
  when done xs-start
  tip From the meeting stone near Thelgen Rock, follow the mountain path up to the portal. A single graveyard serves the area: a wipe means a long walk back.
  goto 47.8,56.2 "Excavation Site" r 25

step Saltspine
  when done xs-start
  tip Clear around him first. Tendon Rip slows the tank hard and his Dust Storm makes everyone within 10 yards miss: casters stay out of it.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share. Talk to Ardin Grassman and Daewyn as soon as you find them inside: their follow-ups start with them.
  task "Saltspine" optional

step The tall grass and Shadetooth
  when done xs-start
  tip The most dangerous stretch: Thicket Lurkers leap out of the tall grass, and Matriarchs call more of them at low health. Keep to the narrow path, fight in the open, kill the others before a Matriarch. Shadetooth comes with two Thicket Hunters (dispel Infected Wound): crowd-control one, kill the other, and fight him in the crocodile cove on the left so his fear cannot throw anyone into the grass.
  collect 284845 quest 98815                  -- Thicket Raptor Hide: Shadetooth and the Thicket raptors

step Daewyn and the Highland Horror
  when done xs-start
  tip The Highland Horror (elite 28) stands right of the Dragonmaw and the burned dig camp; only this one inside drops the rootcore, not the one outside the dungeon.
  turnin 95772 optional                       -- Daewyn: Songblade Search, from Dorin in Lakeshire
  accept 95795 optional
  collect 270180 quest 95646 optional         -- Horrible Rootcore: Highland Horror, elite 28

step Relic Guardian
  when done xs-start
  tip The last boss, level 31, woken by the Archival Panel on its right. Thunderclap slows everyone within 10 yards, and it knocks back and stuns the tank for 5 seconds: rotate stuns and slows, keep healing the tank, kite round the structures if need be. Ardin Grassman waits on the wooden scaffold by its arena.
  turnin 95647                                -- Ardin Grassman, each player talks to him
  accept 95809
  accept 95810 item 270865                    -- Titan Relic, from the Relic Guardian: right-click it

step Rethiel's reward
  when done xs-start
  turnin 95646 optional

step Prospector Whelgar
  when done xs-start
  tip In the small cave of the outdoor dig, west of the road.
  turnin 95810
  accept 98824

step Menethil rewards
  when done xs-start
  turnin 98815                                -- James Halloran: the reward may be missing (bug reported on 07/11)
  turnin 95809                                -- Caitlin Grassman: pick mana potions for casters

step Ironforge: High Explorer Magellas
  when done xs-start
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hall of Explorers. He says you lack the Titan Relic? Abandon the quest and take it again from Whelgar for a new relic.
  turnin 98824

step Lakeshire: Dorin Songblade
  when onquest 95795
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Fly to Lakeshire on your way to Stormwind: Dorin is in the stables past the bridge.
  fly "Lakeshire"
  turnin 95795
